{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106420","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106420","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1410642001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did you find anything?","source_cn":"发现什么了吗？，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x547BC51C95248DD5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did you find anything?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did you find anything?","variant_male_record_index":"163331","variant_female_record_index":"163332","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1410642001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did you find anything?","source_cn":"发现什么了吗？，<style=stress><player_name></style>？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x547BC51C95248DD5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did you find anything?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did you find anything?","variant_male_record_index":"163331","variant_female_record_index":"163332","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410642002:0":{"text":"Really? Why?","source_cn":"什么？有吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C396C70529B92F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Really? Why?","female":"Really? Why?","variant_male_record_index":"163333","variant_female_record_index":"163334","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410642004:1":{"text":"Why would the Sylvan Tendril lead us to examine a rock?","source_cn":"为什么织叶会指引我们观察一块岩石？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B7A6261BFC7CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410642004":{"text":"Why would the Sylvan Tendril lead us to examine a rock?","source_cn":"为什么织叶会指引我们观察一块岩石？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B7A6261BFC7CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410642005:0":{"text":"Now that you mention it... it does kind of look like something. But what exactly?","source_cn":"你这么一说……确实看着是像什么东西，嗯……到底是像什么呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC6A1A6B944D99E3A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Now that you mention it... it does kind of look like something. But what exactly?","female":"Now that you mention it... it does kind of look like something. But what exactly?","variant_male_record_index":"163338","variant_female_record_index":"163339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410642006:0":{"text":"Look at all the rocks above. They form a giant claw.","source_cn":"像是巨大的利爪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA989902B0E29758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410642007:1":{"text":"A c-claw...?","source_cn":"爪、爪子……你是说……这些石头是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1936D344399B2D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1410642007":{"text":"A c-claw...?","source_cn":"爪、爪子……你是说……这些石头是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1936D344399B2D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410642008:0":{"text":"What?! But it's so dark and grimy!","source_cn":"——这是龙爪？！就这个黑黢黢的东西？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD38942CF8EBD9DDA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What?! But it's so dark and grimy!","female":"What?! But it's so dark and grimy!","variant_male_record_index":"163342","variant_female_record_index":"163343","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410642009:0":{"text":"Wait... I just remembered something! By Helthor's pinky! The dragon was right in front of us this whole time!","source_cn":"等等……我……我想起来了！赫托啊……龙一直就在我们眼前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA3AADCB2165F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410642010:0":{"text":"According to the records, \"The Primordial Dragon: its form as a mighty mountain, its body as a vast hill, its wings obscuring the heavens. Those who beheld its true form were filled with wonder at its boundless might.\"","source_cn":"史书上说过……“初始之龙，其形若山，其体如丘，展翅可遮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7CEE30681E07B0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410642011:0":{"text":"How did I miss that? The Primordial Dragon's body is like a mountain!","source_cn":"——初始之龙的身体像山一样庞大！我怎么没想到呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D01B37D771F71B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410642012:1":{"text":"To bind such a gigantic creature here... What kind of terrifying magic is that?","source_cn":"能将如此巨大的生物束缚在这里……好可怕的魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F1AC2952A09BCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410642013:0":{"text":"Only a few in Sal'thorin could use such an intricate spell.","source_cn":"整个萨洛克兰，能使用如此复杂术式的艾塞勒并不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52810361749F689E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1410642013":{"text":"Only a few in Sal'thorin could use such an intricate spell.","source_cn":"整个萨洛克兰，能使用如此复杂术式的艾塞勒并不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52810361749F689E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410642014:0":{"text":"...It could only be the Queen herself.","source_cn":"……只可能是女王亲手所为。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C19C85916A8937","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...It could only be the Queen herself.","female":"...It could only be the Queen herself.","variant_male_record_index":"163349","variant_female_record_index":"163350","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410642015:0":{"text":"Merlin, can you undo this binding spell?","source_cn":"梅林，你能解开这个束缚魔法吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65FC864E1D21E7AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Merlin, can you undo this binding spell?","female":"Merlin, can you undo this binding spell?","variant_male_record_index":"163351","variant_female_record_index":"163352","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1410642015":{"text":"Merlin, can you undo this binding spell?","source_cn":"梅林，你能解开这个束缚魔法吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65FC864E1D21E7AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Merlin, can you undo this binding spell?","female":"Merlin, can you undo this binding spell?","variant_male_record_index":"163351","variant_female_record_index":"163352","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410642016:0":{"text":"Have you thought this through? Do you know what could happen if we break the Primordial Dragon's seal?","source_cn":"你们想好了吗？解开初始之龙的束缚……你们想过后果吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8D229EB6C8E0C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410642017:0":{"text":"Are you scared?","source_cn":"怕了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5BB5ACF0D249F91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410642018:0":{"text":"Ha! Please, I'm so excited, I'm about to burst into flames!","source_cn":"哈！你别小瞧我！我现在兴奋得快要燃烧了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CBC9DB1B086C447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410642019:0":{"text":"Her Majesty must've known about the Primordial Dragon all along and bound it here, all so she could keep draining the dragon eggs.","source_cn":"女王早知道初始之龙的存在，甚至将它束缚于此，只为了龙蛋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76FEFFB1C341A7ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410642020:0":{"text":"Oh, come on... You're overestimating your queen. The Primordial Dragon is on the same level as Helthor. There's no way such a spell could hold it!","source_cn":"哎哎哎……你太抬举你们的女王了。初始之龙可是与赫托老爹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA62546889B94D6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410642021:0":{"text":"Don't underestimate Her Majesty's power.","source_cn":"不然呢？你不该轻视女王拥有的魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7B998DE9B7B045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410642022:0":{"text":"You Essail are so arrogant! If you want a fight, then bring it, you rockknobber!","source_cn":"区区艾塞勒——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA72DCF354291E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1410642022":{"text":"You Essail are so arrogant! If you want a fight, then bring it, you rockknobber!","source_cn":"区区艾塞勒——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA72DCF354291E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410642023:0":{"text":"Merlin's right. Arguing over this is pointless.","source_cn":"……梅林是对的，现在争论这些没有意义。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5DDFE5ECC1118416","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Merlin's right. Arguing over this is pointless.","female":"Merlin's right. Arguing over this is pointless.","variant_male_record_index":"163360","variant_female_record_index":"163361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410642024:0":{"text":"What's important now is that we break the seal and let the Primordial Dragon reveal the truth!","source_cn":"解开束缚！让初始之龙亲口告诉我们真相！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1AB15074EEB0247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410642025:0":{"text":"Merlin, it's all on you.","source_cn":"梅林，靠你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x60A73F1018A85018","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Merlin, it's all on you.","female":"Merlin, it's all on you.","variant_male_record_index":"163363","variant_female_record_index":"163364","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"Enough! I'm trying to focus.","source_cn":"别吵了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x31E9BD0AB8D8184C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Enough! I'm trying to focus.","female":"Enough! I'm trying to focus.","variant_male_record_index":"72562","variant_female_record_index":"72563","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"It'll be a piece of cake.","source_cn":"小菜一碟<key:dialog41>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBB4B97C2BED2B1DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It'll be a piece of cake.","female":"It'll be a piece of cake.","variant_male_record_index":"72558","variant_female_record_index":"72559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"Let me give it a try.","source_cn":"可以试试","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x98C010EC97B6D1F8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let me give it a try.","female":"Let me give it a try.","variant_male_record_index":"72560","variant_female_record_index":"72561","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"Who do you think did it?","source_cn":"你认为是谁？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E4C13529C5328FF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Who do you think did it?","female":"Who do you think did it?","variant_male_record_index":"72556","variant_female_record_index":"72557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"This must be a dragon claw.","source_cn":"是龙的爪子","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x58452C83BD5F9DE6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This must be a dragon claw.","female":"This must be a dragon claw.","variant_male_record_index":"72554","variant_female_record_index":"72555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Take a good look at its shape!","source_cn":"好好看看它的形状！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xECDA95028AC21F69","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Take a good look at its shape!","female":"Take a good look at its shape!","variant_male_record_index":"72552","variant_female_record_index":"72553","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"This rock looks strange.","source_cn":"这块岩石的形状很奇怪","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0D1B8035D10614","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This rock looks strange.","female":"This rock looks strange.","variant_male_record_index":"72548","variant_female_record_index":"72549","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410642003:0":{"text":"Huh? What's being bound though...? Rocks can't move on their own...","source_cn":"束缚？束缚什么……束缚这块石头吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x745580772FA72B4C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Huh? What's being bound though...? Rocks can't move on their own...","female":"Huh? What's being bound though...? Rocks can't move on their own...","variant_male_record_index":"163335","variant_female_record_index":"163336","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"There's a binding magic seal.","source_cn":"这里有束缚魔法的术式","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3553C6F44DB0BE20","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There's a binding magic seal.","female":"There's a binding magic seal.","variant_male_record_index":"72550","variant_female_record_index":"72551","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":40,"localized_text_count":39,"speaker_count":2}}